WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.110 --> 00:00:04.430
Walk out of a damp, shady
wood and onto a sand dune.

2
00:00:04.480 --> 00:00:07.840
The mosses and ferns
thin out, then vanish.

3
00:00:07.890 --> 00:00:11.730
But flowering plants keep going:
marram grass on the dunes,

4
00:00:11.780 --> 00:00:13.950
a cactus on dry ground.

5
00:00:14.000 --> 00:00:17.150
Flowering plants keep every
land feature of a fern,

6
00:00:17.200 --> 00:00:18.750
and add more.

7
00:00:18.800 --> 00:00:22.270
So what lets flowering
plants leave the damp behind?

8
00:00:22.320 --> 00:00:25.340
In this mission, you'll
watch a tree build its trunk,

9
00:00:25.390 --> 00:00:28.650
year on year, and find
out what that gives it.

10
00:00:28.700 --> 00:00:31.280
Then you'll slice through
a marram grass leaf,

11
00:00:31.330 --> 00:00:34.750
and find the tricks it uses
to hold on to its water.

12
00:00:34.800 --> 00:00:39.470
Your mission: find out what lets
flowering plants leave the damp behind.
